Bottom Line
The week=E2=80=99s most important change is the Villages settlement: unsuppor=
ted MA diagnoses can create simultaneous provider solvency risk, payer repaym=
ent exposure and RADV complexity. Delegated-provider coding governance theref=
ore requires the closest attention. The next scheduled catalyst is September =
15, when quality ratings and Aetna=E2=80=99s distribution changes will provid=
e new evidence on 2027 MA revenue and enrollment positioning.
